EpiMediaHub Admin V2 — PRIVATE SIGNED BUILD REQUEST

Build: v2.0.0
Android package: de.epimediahub.admin
Version code: 200001
Source: merge of PR #96 into main
Trigger: one-time main-branch push matched by epimediahub-admin-private-release.yml

The workflow can use only GitHub Actions' private existing
EPI_ADMIN_RELEASE_SIGNING_JSON and EPI_ADMIN_FIREBASE_CLIENT_JSON secrets.
It MUST validate signer fingerprint and produce a short-lived private
workflow artifact; no GitHub Release/public download or automatic APK upload.

This request does not authorize unsafe default app installs, rotating the
existing keystore, publishing player-app updates, or enabling incomplete
expiry-report/FCM automation. Deployment onto the private Admin updater is
a separate SHA-256 verified, owner-account action after signer review.
